1. The Android Open Source Project — Music app          Apache License 2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Choir began as, and remains, a port of the AOSP Music application. The following
parts are derivative works of that code, reimplemented in Kotlin:

  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/core/MusicUtils.kt
      Duration and metadata formatting, after MusicUtils.

  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/core/MusicLog.kt
      Logging front-end, after MusicLog.

  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/data/MediaStoreRepository.kt
      MediaStore audio, playlist and playlist-member queries, including the
      IS_MUSIC selection and the disc/track number encoding, after the queries
      in TrackBrowserActivity and PlaylistBrowserActivity.

  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/playback/PlaybackService.kt
      Background playback service and saved-queue behaviour, after
      MediaPlaybackService.

  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/ui/library/
  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/ui/detail/
  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/ui/search/
      Browse, drill-down and search screens, after MusicBrowserActivity,
      AlbumBrowserActivity, ArtistAlbumBrowserActivity, TrackBrowserActivity,
      PlaylistBrowserActivity and QueryBrowserActivity.

  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/ui/picker/
      Audio picker, after MusicPicker.

  app/src/main/java/app/auriel/choir/ui/nowplaying/
      Playback screen, after MediaPlaybackActivity.

